# Local settings. .env.example is the documented template and is published.
.env

# The Discord posts, kept on this machine only - it is the paste buffer, not
# something a reader of the repository or an installed mod folder needs. The
# installer skips it too (DEV_ONLY_FILES in installer/lib/deployment.js).
ANNOUNCEMENT.md

# The Discord hand-out ZIP, built by tools/BuildPackage.bat. It stays on this
# machine: the repository is the distribution, so nothing under dist/ is pushed
# and nothing under it is ever attached to a Release.
dist/

# Installed dependencies
node_modules/

# Scratch
*.log
*.tmp

# Installer rollback snapshots
_*backup*/